<title>USA: First Call to distribute to 5 Canadian brokerages.</title>
<headline>First Call to distribute to 5 Canadian brokerages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call said on Thursday it signed distribution agreements with five Canadian brokers -- Deacon Capital Corp, Griffiths McBurney &amp; Partners, Peters &amp; Co Ltd, Research Capital and Sprott Securities.</p>
<p>Boston-based First Call, which is part of Thomson Corp affiliate Thomson Financial Services, said it would distribute morning meeting notes and intra-day research broadcasts electronically and in real-time to their clients over FIRST CALL Notes.</p>
<p>The company said it now distributed these services to 19 Canadian brokers.</p>
<p>((--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
